          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;A year has passed since the war ended. Catra's and Adora's relationship has blossomed to new heights. They have shared many beautiful moments, many unforgettable memories and many unbreakable promises. Adora wants to add to them all for the rest of her life... she just hopes Catra wants that too.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
